{"id":"H4920","lemma":"מְשֶׁלֶמְיָהוּ","transliteration":"meshelemyah","sayIt":"me-she-lem-yah","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Meshelemiah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at 1Ch.9.21;\nfather of: Zechariah (H2148A), Jediael (H3043J), Zebadiah (H2069J), Jathniel (H3496), Elam (H5867H), Jehohanan (H3076I) and Eliehoenai (H0454A); also called Shelemiah at 1Ch.26.14;\nAlso named: she.lem.yah (שֶׁלֶמְיָהוּ \"Shelemiah\" H8018O)\n§ Meshelemiah = \"whom Jehovah repays\"\na Korhite Levite porter or gatekeeper of the house of God in the time of David","glosses":["meshelemiah"],"count":4,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Meshelemiah","kjv":"of Meshelemiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-26","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Meshelemiah","kjv":"was Meshelemiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-26","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"Meshelemiah","kjv":"of Meshelemiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-26","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"Meshelemiah","kjv":"And Meshelemiah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 9:21","note":"Zechariah the son of Meshelemiah was gatekeeper of the door of the Tent of Meeting.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H8018","lemma":"שֶׁלֶמְיָהוּ","transliteration":"shelemyah","gloss":"Shelemiah"},{"id":"H0454","lemma":"אֶלְיְהוֹעֵינַי","transliteration":"elyehoenay","gloss":"Eliehoenai"},{"id":"H2069","lemma":"זְבַדְיָהוּ","transliteration":"zevadyah","gloss":"Zebadiah"},{"id":"H2148","lemma":"זְכַרְיָהוּ","transliteration":"zekharyah","gloss":"Zechariah"},{"id":"H3043","lemma":"יְדִיעֲאֵל","transliteration":"yediael","gloss":"Jediael"},{"id":"H3076","lemma":"יְהוֹחָנָן","transliteration":"yehochanan","gloss":"Johanan"},{"id":"H3496","lemma":"יַתְנִיאֵל","transliteration":"yatniel","gloss":"Jathniel"},{"id":"H5867","lemma":"עֵילָם","transliteration":"elam","gloss":"Elam"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}